        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:reason#e-84e1b3056185856b",
          "text": "When Claude itself is asked to reason, printing out its chain of thought to answer maths questions, the microscope suggests that the way the model says it reached a conclusion, and what it actually thought, might not always be the same.",
